msgid "plugins.generic.smartTemplate.name"
msgstr "Smart Manuscript Template"

msgid "plugins.generic.smartTemplate.description"
msgstr "A Word template with the journal's specification: fonts and sizes, margins, styles for headings, Qur'anic verses, footnotes and references, the mandatory section headings and brief in-file guidance. It is prefilled with the author's submission data (both titles, abstracts, keywords, authors) in a full and an anonymised version, with a public link to the blank template. Compatible with the suite's technical check and JATS conversion. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

